<title>USA: Advanta settles with Visa USA, Mastercard.</title>
<headline>Advanta settles with Visa USA, Mastercard.</headline>
<dateline>SPRING HOUSE, Pa. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Advanta Corp said Thursday that it has reached an agreement with MasterCard International and Visa U.S.A. under which Advanta has agreed to discontinue offering the Rewards Accelerator card.</p>
<p>The card had enabled cardholders to earn rewards points redeemable in American Express Co's Membership Rewards program.</p>
<p>All lawsuits on the issue have been dropped, Advanta said. None of the parties involved sought or received any money as part of the settlement.  </p>
<p>Advanta remains a member in good standing in both the MasterCard and Visa associations, the company said.</p>
</text>
